cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or these data, please cite both the paper and this repository."
title: "Termite trap gas sensing: code and data for a networked multi-gas sensing system for in-trap monitoring of termite-associated CO2 and CH4"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code and measurements for a networked multi-gas sensing system that
  estimates termite abundance from CO2 accumulation inside sealed monitoring
  traps. Contains the tidy dataset (8 termite chambers, 105-500 workers, plus
  one blank control per batch, three batches), the acquisition-format
  workbooks, and the code that regenerates every table and figure of the paper.
